# Force LF for the macOS toolkit. Shell scripts with CRLF line endings fail
# on macOS with "bad interpreter" errors, so pin everything here to LF
# regardless of the cloner's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.command text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.py      text eol=lf
*.conf    text eol=lf
*.txt     text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
